From 120209e6b31f39c3342dbfe17dbcf7ac77bce7a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sagar Cheluvegowda <quic_scheluve@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Aug 2024 17:46:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/16] PENDING: net: PCS: Add Qualcomm XPCS driver

Add a new Qualcomm driver for XPCS block adding
below support
1. Qualcomm XPCS adds support for XPCS IP-core from synopsys.
2. Qualcomm XPCS supports Clause37 auto negotiation for
USXGMII interface.
3. Qualcomm XPCS uses direct read/writes via APB3 bus.
4. Qualcomm Xpcs has auto negotiation interrupt support.
5. Qualcomm Xpcs is made a platform driver exposing callbacks
to phylink layer for performing actions like validate,
link up, etc.

Change-Id: If1273d737643332239cf439d7593fc9562826136
Signed-off-by: Sagar Cheluvegowda <quic_scheluve@quicinc.com>
(cherry picked from commit 7aefec96c50281df049c5ea3bfd3c65e509974bb)
